Z||000008||Old Lar||04-29-2001||05:19 PM||||You should check out the parts places for the cost of parts<P>You really need to go to an engine rebuilder to get a real cost.  I'd expect it would cost between $1000-1500, if not more.  Once the engines get tore down, you mey find the unexpected.<P>It may be cheaper to buy a remanufactured engine up front and have it installed.<p>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 04-29-2001).]||||reg||1
